# Measured by two agreeing counted runs through core/scripts/hermetic-run.sh (the judge's own J3 output). The starts
# are run.sh itself (1), the two cli cells of cells.decl (2), and the battery's two inner runs of this script's copy
# (2), one per mutant. inproc rows (fx_inproc, one per source): the hook once in the outer run and each mutant copy
# once in its inner run, at $MB/core/hooks/ai-dlc-escalation-delivery.sh.
5 *
2 core/hooks/ai-dlc-escalation-delivery.sh
3 inproc:core/hooks/ai-dlc-escalation-delivery.sh
